..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : PRICEMAINTENANCE.SET.ROWREMOVAL
.. Autor          : fwester
.. Verantwortlich : cl
.. Kontrolle      : tiwe
.. Functionality  : Marks row to be removed or not. Each row that has only values
.. that are zero will be marked to be removed. The pricing database editor itsself
.. removes such rows implicitly. Considering this behaviour in the infosystem, we
.. have to mark such rows in item tremoverow.
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.continue END   ?  F|empty(M|aktzeile)
.continue PRICE ? _M|ktyprabatt
..
.. Discount row
.copy M|tremoverow = F|empty(M|mgrenzeneu) & F|empty(M|mprozneu) & F|empty(M|mnrabneu)
.continue END
..
!PRICE
.copy M|tremoverow = F|empty(M|mgrenzeneu) & F|empty(M|mpreisneu) & F|empty(M|mnpreisneu)
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
